<title>UK: SocGen names Spencer UK equity sales head.</title>
<headline>SocGen names Spencer UK equity sales head.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>French banking group Societe Generale said on Tuesday it had appointed Gavin Spencer as a director to run its UK Equity Sales Trading Operation in London.</p>
<p>SocGen said Spencer previously worked at Salomon Brothers as head of UK sales trading.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
